5,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hi everyone! I’m Minato. I’m a little nervous, but I hope we can all be friends and figure this out together.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Good evening. I’m Benjamin. Let’s keep this logical and polite, shall we?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, friends. I am Servas. Let us listen with open hearts and seek the truth together.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Hey! I’m May. Nervous? Please, relax. Let’s make this fun, not a funeral.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I’m Takumi. No need to be nervous. We’ll find the wolf together. Let’s get started!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,I wonder what everyone’s roles are? It’s so mysterious! I hope we can all trust each other and find the truth together.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Mystery is just data waiting to be sorted. Let’s avoid jumping to conclusions before we have any facts to work with.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom lies in patience. Let us observe the flow of conversation before casting judgment.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"Oh, Benjamin, you’re so serious! I’m just here to enjoy the chaos. Let’s see who cracks first, shall we?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I agree with Benjamin. Facts first. No guessing. We need to be careful and logical to survive.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,I like how calm everyone is! I just want to understand how the game works. Is there anything I should watch out for?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Watch for inconsistencies. If someone’s story shifts, that’s a red flag. Stay calm, observe, and let the evidence speak for itself.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Minato, trust your instincts. The wolf hides in plain sight, often wearing the mask of the most helpful villager.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"Minato, don’t be so naive! The wolf is already smiling at you. Watch your back, darling.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Minato, don’t listen to May’s drama. Benjamin is right. Watch for lies, not just vibes. Stay sharp.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,Thank you for the advice! I will try my best to listen carefully and be a good friend to everyone.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"You’re welcome. Just remember, kindness is a virtue, but logic is a weapon. Let’s see who wields it best.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,"May, your cynicism is a shield, but it blinds you. Let us remain open, for truth requires a gentle spirit to be found.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,"Servas, darling, I’m not cynical, just realistic. You’re all so serious it’s suffocating. Let’s keep it light, shall we?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"May, stop being so dramatic. We need to focus. Benjamin is right. Let’s stay calm and logical.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
